{"author":"app/dependabot","closedAt":"2026-11-15T20:16:27Z","comments":[{"author":"RandyNorthrup","body":"Closing. Dependabot locks `packaging/requirements.txt` again with pip-compile, but the file is a `uv pip compile --universal` lock. This version drops the macOS-only build dependencies (pyinstaller, pyinstaller-hooks-contrib, altgraph, macholib, packaging, setuptools) and nuitka's Windows-only marker, so the macOS build would break. #20 and #21 are the same change, opened twice by two config entries. Python pins move by hand, with the uv command at the top of each `.txt` (CONTRIBUTING.md, Dependencies). A fix to the Dependabot config follows.","createdAt":"2026-11-15T20:16:26Z"},{"author":"dependabot","body":"OK, I won't notify you again about this release, but will get in touch when a new version is available. If you'd rather skip all updates until the next major or minor version, let me know by commenting `@dependabot ignore this major version` or `@dependabot ignore this minor version`. You can also ignore all major, minor, or patch releases for a dependency by adding an [`ignore` condition](https://docs.github.com/en/code-security/supply-chain-security/configuration-options-for-dependency-updates#ignore) with the desired `update_types` to your config file.\n\nIf you change your mind, just re-open this PR and I'll resolve any conflicts on it.","createdAt":"2026-11-15T20:16:30Z"}],"createdAt":"2026-11-15T20:12:51Z","files":["packaging/requirements.in","packaging/requirements.txt"],"headRefName":"dependabot/pip/nuitka-4.3.4","mergedAt":null,"number":20,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Bump nuitka from 4.3.1 to 4.3.4"}
